= Graph trial adapter regression control

2026-10-22. P29 vertex 0, fixed public input, eight target coefficients. The
first attempt stopped at wrapper import because the control environment did
not have PyYAML. The study-admission import now occurs only in scientific mode.

#image("control_flow.svg", width: 100%)

The retained retry completed input verification, Rust collection, independent
C++ ordered counting, and Python rank replay. The checker accepted all eight
targets and 512 signed base points; ordered counts matched. This particular
input had zero useful targets and zero rank increments. The failed attempt and
the successful retry both remain under this directory with commands, digests,
logs and receipts.

This is an adapter control. It makes no graph-wide yield, P37 capacity, or
ECDLP-cost statement.
